menu "CSI Sender"

    config CSI_SEND_PERIOD_MS
        int "Interval between ESP-NOW packets (ms)"
        range 2 1000
        default 10
        help
            10 ms = 100 packets/s. The receiver gets one CSI sample per packet,
            so this is the CSI sampling rate. The spec asks for 50-100 Hz.

endmenu
